{"decision":"pass","rationale":"Publish now writes the result file through journal.WriteFileAtomic with 0o600, as issue #7230 asked. It still wraps failures in ResultWriteError. The test already checked content, and the diff adds a mode assertion. journal.WriteFileAtomic exists, and a grep of non-test journal files found no import of prstatus, so there is no import cycle. I did not compile or run anything. The local-ci gate covers that.","summary":"Atomic 0o600 result write in prstatus.Publish with a mode test; in scope and correct."}